                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Creature Clicker is confusing, no guidance, and very buggy.\nAchievements don't unlock. When you open and close the profile some unlock sometimes. Still several with conditions met don't unlock.\nEven navigating through your creatures shows you all when going forward, but misses one when going leftwards.\nProgression is slow.\nUI starts with a lot of stuff you can't even use yet. Menus are confusing.\n\nThis dev seems to spam bad games with a ton of DLC.\nAnd please use my default webbrowser when opening weblinks, not Edge.",
